  "title": "A common neural mechanism underlies experiences of passage of time",
  "description": "This dataset contains raw EEG and behavioral data collected to investigate the common neural mechanisms underlying subjective experiences of passage of time. Participants completed behavioral tasks assessing subjective time perception while EEG was recorded. The data are organized in BIDS format to facilitate reuse and reanalysis by the neuroscience community.",
